hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2805","**\nNarrated to us Abu 'Ammar al-Hasan ibn Hurayth: narrated to us 'Abdullah ibn Numayr, on the authority of Yahya ibn Sa'id, from 'Abdullah ibn Abi Salamah, from 'Abdullah ibn 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar, from his father, who said:\n\We set out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) from Mina to 'Arafat. Some of us were reciting the Talbiyah"," and some were reciting the Takbir.\""\n\nAbu Bakr said: \""I do not know of anyone among those who narrated this report from Yahya ibn Sa'id who followed Ibn Numayr in including 'Abdullah ibn 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar in this chain. I have indeed recorded the various paths of this report in my book al-Kabir.\"""""
